      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-07-26_WidnesExaminer_art0029" n="art0029">
        <head>BEST HOUSE FOR WATCH AND JEWELLERY REPAIRS.</head>
        <p>BEST HOUSE FOR WATCH AND JEWELLERY REPAIRS.</p>
