        <p>o NEWTON IST V. STANLEY In Newton u.—Played at Saturday 'wt. Score : STANLEY. NEWTON. 5 G moor„ itindiev b S Henderson b Battereby 6 Huish l9 W Turtou C Lightfoot b TN SraYth b Itylance B Hoyle c Williams biluish 12 II Carson lbw b Wilson 9 It Clleig c Williams h Huish 4 H Store- c Rol aeux b H Makeplace not out l4 Battersby ......)............ 21 G Molyneux a Turton b F Huish c Mol3deux b Hutch Battersby c Rylanca b H Barr lbw b Wilson Hindley W n Sharp c Hindley b T Williams b Battersby 9 Huish R Lightfoot a, Hindley b C Hindley c Gieig 1, Huish TB Wilson b Nuielo T L Williams b Carson Extras 4</p>
