        <p>NORWICII YELLOW :-1, 1. E R Godwin (Hyde's). CREST BRED : 1. J D Leigh (Hyde's). MULE, ANY VARIETY : 1, I Unswerth ; 3,2, J linsworth ; c,3, J Unmorth; 2,4, J Lowe ; v b c, 5, El C!are ; 1,6, E R Godwin ; he, 7, H Clare. MULE OLD BIRD •-1 1 W Buckley, _ - .</p>
        <p>f: BROWN LINNET :-1, I,J Lowe; 2, 2. ER Godwin. GOLDFINCH OR BULLY :-1. 1. J Lowe ; 2.2, J Lowell HYDE'S SPECIAL :-1. J D Leigh; 2, F Barrows ; 3, J Waine ;1,4, ER Godwin ; 5,3 Ryder; 6, ER Godwin; 7, W Bray ; 8, W Bray.</p>
